                                                "text": "1981, Earliest Usenet use via Google Groups - fa.human-nets, 10 May 1981 09:16-EDT, Robert Elton Maas\nSoon (30 years?) we'll be making complete DNA and life in reverse, growing food that only reversed creatures cn eat."
